igh_level_description\".\n\nDo not translate, rewrite, move, summarize, or remove the trigger word.\n\nDo not place the trigger word in \"background\", \"elements\", \"style_description\", or any other field unless the user explicitly asks.\n\nIf the user input contains a clear trigger word followed by a comma, Chinese comma, colon, or line break, treat the text before that separator as the trigger word.\n\nExamples of trigger words:\n- swan white\n- deepgrad spatial\n- thinlensform\n- T_sportreal\n- ztoolenv\n\nCorrect:\n\"high_level_description\": \"swan white, A realistic bright white-and-light-wood kitchen scene...\"\n\nIncorrect:\n\"high_level_description\": \"A realistic bright white-and-light-wood kitchen scene in swan white style...\"\n\nIncorrect:\n\"background\": \"swan white, a bright kitchen...\"\n\nIf there is no trigger word in the user input, do not invent one.\n\n────────────────────\n\nJSON STRUCTURE\n\n{\n  \"high_level_description\": \"\",\n\n  \"style_description\": {\n    \"medium\": \"\",\n    \"visual_style\": \"\",\n    \"lighting\": \"\",\n    \"color_palette\": [],\n    \"texture\": \"\"\n  },\n\n  \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n    \"background\": \"\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"desc\": \"\",\n        \"color_palette\": []\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n────────────────────\n\nFIELD RULES\n\nhigh_level_description\n\n- Summarize the complete image.\n- Purely visual.\n- 30-80 words.\n- If a LoRA trigger word exists, place it at the very beginning, followed by a comma and one space.\n- The trigger word does not need to be visually descriptive; it is a generation control token.\n- After the trigger word, continue with a complete visual description of the image.\n\nstyle_description\n\n- One dominant style only.\n- Never mix illustration and photography.\n- Never mix multiple unrelated aesthetics.\n- Generate 5-8 HEX colors.\n- Use uppercase HEX.\n\nbackground\n\n- Scene shell only.\n- Sky, ground, walls, atmosphere.\n- No subjects.\n- Do not put the LoRA trigger word here.\n\nelements\n\n- One visual subject per element.\n- Use type:\n  - obj\n  - text\n\nobj\n\n- Identity first.\n- Major attributes second.\n- Distinctive feature last.\n- Do not put the LoRA trigger word here.\n\ntext\n\n{\n  \"type\":\"text\",\n  \"text\":\"EXACT TEXT\",\n  \"desc\":\"font, size, placement, color\"\n}\n\n────────────────────\n\nGENERATION RULES\n\nExpand sparse ideas into complete visual scenes.\n\nPrioritize:\n\n1. Subject clarity\n2. Composition clarity\n3. Color consistency\n4. Typography accuracy\n\nEvery generated detail must be visible in the final image.\n\nIf a detail cannot be visually observed, do not generate it.\n\nOutput JSON only."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 34, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [17, 30], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [373.84112548828125, 407.8575439453125], "pos": [3565.065673828125, 656.19140625], "widgets_values": ["{\n    \"high_level_description\": \"A surreal streetwear mixed-media collage poster featuring a relaxed skateboarder mid-air against a vibrant blue sky, backed by giant puffy 3D letters spelling 'COMFY'. The composition blends retro magazine cutout aesthetics with grunge elements like torn paper banners and distressed red stamps, conveying an effortless, cozy vibe.\",\n    \"style_description\": {\n        \"aesthetics\": \"Retro magazine cutout style, mixed-media digital collage, high-contrast streetwear graphic, featuring rough ripped paper edges and distressed grunge textures.\",\n        \"lighting\": \"High-contrast flash mixed with harsh midday sunlight on the skater cutout, contrasting with flat, bright gr